   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WDA201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Writing in the Digital age — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14060 · Decision 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WDA201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Writing in the Digital age — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14060 · QĐ 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">WDA201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Writing in the Digital age_Kỹ năng Viết trong kỷ nguyên số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 1.5h final exam + 105.5h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lectures, Social Constructivism,Cooperative Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">14060</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 04/09/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">4/9/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">WDA201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Writing in the Digital age_Kỹ năng Viết trong kỷ nguyên số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 1.5h final exam + 105.5h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lectures, Social Constructivism,Cooperative Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">14060</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 04/09/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">4/9/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This course offers an introduction to the fundamental principles of PR writing, with a specific focus on the influence of integrating artificial intelligence (AI). In the digital age, PR writing has evolved, using diverse channels such as blogs and social media. This evolution surpasses traditional press releases by incorporating the real-time nature of tweets, Instagram stories, LinkedIn posts, and the like. These versatile technologies enable a broad spectrum of approaches to PR writing and engagement, illustrating a noteworthy advancement in public relations techniques that are adept at navigating an ever-evolving communication environment. Upon successful completion of this course, students will acquire:<br><br>1. A comprehensive understanding of the transformative impact of digital spaces on information flow and knowledge acquisition, including the ability to distinguish between linear and non-linear media.<br><br>2. Proficiency in employing digital writing techniques to enhance readability and user engagement.<br><br>3. Mastery in editing for digital media to ensure accuracy and clarity, while adapting to the evolving roles of digital editors and content producers.<br><br>4. Ability to strategically utilize multimedia storytelling and public relations techniques, address legal considerations, and combat misinformation to maintain credibility and trust in digital journalism.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This course offers an introduction to the fundamental principles of PR writing, with a specific focus on the influence of integrating artificial intelligence (AI). In the digital age, PR writing has evolved, using diverse channels such as blogs and social media. This evolution surpasses traditional press releases by incorporating the real-time nature of tweets, Instagram stories, LinkedIn posts, and the like. These versatile technologies enable a broad spectrum of approaches to PR writing and engagement, illustrating a noteworthy advancement in public relations techniques that are adept at navigating an ever-evolving communication environment. Upon successful completion of this course, students will acquire:<br><br>1. A comprehensive understanding of the transformative impact of digital spaces on information flow and knowledge acquisition, including the ability to distinguish between linear and non-linear media.<br><br>2. Proficiency in employing digital writing techniques to enhance readability and user engagement.<br><br>3. Mastery in editing for digital media to ensure accuracy and clarity, while adapting to the evolving roles of digital editors and content producers.<br><br>4. Ability to strategically utilize multimedia storytelling and public relations techniques, address legal considerations, and combat misinformation to maintain credibility and trust in digital journalism.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14060\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14060</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14060\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14060</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
